.TH NSSWITCH-AUDIT 1 "2026-10-13" "SASD Freeware" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
nsswitch-audit \- structural nss switch-file diagnosis
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B nsswitch-audit
[options] [--help | --version]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read-only syntactic checks of Linux-style nsswitch.conf files. Reports structural errors and notes, without interpreting NSS modules. On non-Linux hosts an explicit file must be supplied.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file PATH
Inspect explicit nsswitch-compatible text. Required on non-Linux platforms.
.TP
.B --help
Display help and exit.
.TP
.B --version
Display version and exit.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success/clean; 1 unsuccessful/finding; 2 invalid arguments; 3 missing prerequisites or unexpected errors.
.SH SECURITY
Only read-only checks. Query tools can send network traffic; configure only authorized targets.
